<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 427 &amp; 278-6 V ENGLAND 313 - LUNCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 427 &amp; 278-6 V ENGLAND 313 - LUNCH.</headline>
<dateline>NOTTINGHAM, England 1997-08-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia, 114 ahead of England on first innings, were 278-6 in their second innings at lunch on the fourth day of the fifth Ashes test on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 427 and 278-6, England 313.</p>
</text>
